# HP50g stock ARMToolbox install probe.
# Format: <absolute-ms> <tap|chord|capture|fail|monitor|finish-install> [args...]
# In PICK DESTINATION, 3:SD is initially highlighted. Move DOWN once to HOME,
# confirm with F6, then inspect HOME's VAR menu to verify the converted object.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
7000 chord lshift files
9200 capture files
9500 tap up
9800 tap f6
11500 capture sd
12000 tap enter
12800 capture sd-setup
13200 tap f2
14200 capture copy
14300 tap down
14600 tap f6
16500 capture copy-result
17000 tap on
18000 capture home-after-copy
18500 tap var
19800 capture vars
20000 fail vars-after-copy-probe
